        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A&nbsp;</span>glowing one<span class=\"fontstyle0\">&nbsp;which is prone and not moving is difficult to tell apart from a corpse. It takes a </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\"><strong>PER + Survival</strong> </span><span class=\"fontstyle0\">test, difficulty 2, to spot a ghoul which is currently &lsquo;playing dead&rsquo;. They often use this to ambush unsuspecting passers-by.</span></p>",
